# Collector fleet lesson

A collector failure is not closed on the name that failed.

- Review every collector for that same failure mode.
- Apply the fix where the mode matches.
- Leave a name out only when it is different by design: cash vs DIV-1, pay interval, ROC scope. Say which names were reviewed, which were left out, and why.
- Do not hardcode the failing symbol. A new interval (for example 24 pays a year) is allowed when it is stored on the position.

Green goldens alone are not Done if the live book was dirty. Include an owner DB sample when it was.
